# Brand masters. Supplied separately, 0.66-1.94 MB each, and this repository is
# public. scripts/build-brand-assets.mjs derives the web assets from them and
# skips cleanly when they are absent, so only regenerating needs them.
/neurodyne.png
/neurodyne_*.png

# Internal working documents. Supplied separately, and this repository is
# public — these are positioning, brand and compliance working notes, not code.
# The durable public summaries live in docs/NEURODYNE_POSITIONING.md and
# docs/NEURODYNE_BRAND.md. Untracked is not the same as ignored: these were one
# `git add -A` away from being published.
/*.docx
/INTERNAL_*.md
